= 进军柏林

The far right is mobilizing. Paramilitary forces of the Stahlhelm and SA, organized under the Harzburg Front, have marched on Berlin, threatening to violently seize power. Forces of the Interior and Reichswehr ministries have been deployed in the streets under orders from their respective Nazi-controlled ministries and have begun securing key points across the country. Clearly, [+ president +] has tired of our attempts to constitutionally obstruct his plans and has decided to ignore the constitution.

- @fight: 我们要在街头战斗,阻止希特勒掌权。
- @give_up: 我们无能为力。


@fight
on-arrival: spd_rebel = 1

我们明白这意味着什么吗?这意味着要对抗国家的全部武力,打一场内战。

- @civil_war: 是。
- @give_up: 我们还没准备好开战。我们无能为力。

@give_up

Speeches are made. Votes are held. Bullets fly in the streets. Some socialists are killed or jailed. Others flee the country. The Nazis with total control over the streets unilaterally suspend the constitution.

德国沦陷了。

- @game_over
